        <a class="lien" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=403+rue+Henri+Deshays+59111+Bouchain">Itinéraire<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg></a>
